on justASecond pauseTime
  [  0] pushint8 34 ............................. <34>
  [  3] get 7 ................................... <the timer>
  [  5] setlocal 0 .............................. tt = the timer
  [  7] pushint8 34 ............................. <34>
  [ 10] get 7 ................................... <the timer>
  [ 12] getlocal 0 .............................. <tt>
  [ 14] getparam 0 .............................. <pauseTime>
  [ 16] add ..................................... <tt + pauseTime>
  [ 17] lt ...................................... <the timer < (tt + pauseTime)>
  [ 18] jmpifz [ 23] ............................ repeat while the timer < (tt + pauseTime)
  [ 21] endrepeat [  7]
  [ 23] ret
end
